# Local scratch model repos.
#
# `examples/retail` is its own git repository with its own remote : it is a personal test
# workspace, not a product example. Committing it here would add a submodule gitlink, so anyone
# cloning would get an empty directory and a confusing error.
#
# `examples/quickstart` is the committed example and the dev default. It is small, valid, and
# checked by CI, so a fresh clone opens on something real.
examples/retail/

# Design notes. notes/README.md says these are working documents, not published.
notes/
